  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;The proposal is NOT therefore a lawful development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The cubic content of the proposed&amp;nbsp;roof alterations and extensions to form an end gable and rear dormer would exceed the cubic content of the original roof space by more than 50 cubic metres. The proposal&amp;nbsp;is therefore not within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class B, Class B.1 (d.ii) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The enlarged part of the dwellinghouse would extend beyond a wall which fronts a highway and forms a side elevation of the original dwellinghouse. The proposal&amp;nbsp;is therefore not within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, Class A.1 (e.ii) of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
